From: well83 <well83@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 10:27:15 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] bcmdhd: add BCM43342 firmware name (LG642 / AP6334 clone, T95
 AXP313A)

Stock T95 firmware A27/A29 maps chip 43342 rev 1 to fw_bcm43342_ag.bin.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 drivers/net/wireless/bcmdhd/dhd_config.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/net/wireless/bcmdhd/dhd_config.c b/drivers/net/wireless/bcmdhd/dhd_config.c
index 0ac1919c9..5ab0a75c0 100644
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/bcmdhd/dhd_config.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/bcmdhd/dhd_config.c
@@ -80,6 +80,7 @@ const cihp_name_map_t chip_name_map[] = {
 	{BCM4334_CHIP_ID,	3,	DONT_CARE,	FALSE,	"bcm4334b1_ag",		""},
 	{BCM43340_CHIP_ID,	2,	DONT_CARE,	FALSE,	"bcm43341b0_ag",	""},
 	{BCM43341_CHIP_ID,	2,	DONT_CARE,	FALSE,	"bcm43341b0_ag",	""},
+	{BCM43342_CHIP_ID,	1,	DONT_CARE,	FALSE,	"bcm43342_ag",		""},
 	{BCM4324_CHIP_ID,	5,	DONT_CARE,	FALSE,	"bcm43241b4_ag",	""},
 	{BCM4335_CHIP_ID,	2,	DONT_CARE,	FALSE,	"bcm4339a0_ag",		""},
 	{BCM4339_CHIP_ID,	1,	DONT_CARE,	FALSE,	"bcm4339a0_ag",		""},
